# Another app's card in front, then the application manager's launch with a target: the call an app makes for a
# tapped link (T-653).
id: mojo-launch-from-app
section: Keyboard and text
item: Mojo: open a link to the browser from another app (an email or a message): the card shows the page with no keyboard over it
shells: mojo
page: about:blank
kit: cavekit-chrome-look.md R4
launch-from com.palm.app.notes http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
wait url jihad-long-static 30
expect keyboard down
expect content 0,150,756,600 'sel:body'
